  "content": "<p><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" alt=\"曝光\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">胶片摄影模组</h2><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_camera.png\" alt=\"相机\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_film.png\" alt=\"胶片\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_developing.png\" alt=\"冲洗\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_printing.png\" alt=\"打印\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_photograph.png\" alt=\"照片\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br></div><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_additional_features.png\" alt=\"附加功能\" width=\"260\"></p><div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_chromatic.png\" alt=\"色差\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_projector.gif\" alt=\"界面投影仪\" width=\"1000\"> <br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure-polaroid\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_polaroid.png\" alt=\"宝丽来\" width=\"1000\"></a> <br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exposure-catalog\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_catalog.png\" alt=\"目录\" width=\"1000\"></a> <br><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_negatives.png\" alt=\"底片\" width=\"1000\"></div><p>&nbsp;</p><div><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HI9Bnjc9HYs\" width=\"1000\" height=\"380\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></div><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmoddedmc.wiki%252fen%252fproject%252fexposure%252flatest%252fdocs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/wiki.png\" alt=\"维基\" width=\"200\" height=\"62\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>已知不兼容：</strong></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">- <strong>Optifine</strong> - 已知会导致与其他模组的问题。请使用 Sodium/Embeddium 替代。</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">- <strong>Visual Overhaul</strong> - 打开相机控制时崩溃 - <a href=\"https://github.com/mortuusars/Exposure/issues/19\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Issue</a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">- <strong>Exordium</strong> - 从取景器观看时引起问题和闪烁。</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">- <strong>FastAnim</strong>（Fabric） - 打破相机下玩家模型动画。 <a href=\"https://github.com/mortuusars/Exposure/issues/71\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github Issue</a></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">喜欢这个模组吗？您的支持将使我能够继续开发它以及其他模组！</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars/membership\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon_seamless.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"558.73\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fhosted_button_id%253d4VPMCBCLZVUEA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal_seamless.png\" alt=\"PayPal\" width=\"191.75\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars/posts/rewards-129739244\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_golden_camera.png\" alt=\"金色相机\" width=\"1000\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord 服务器\" width=\"550\" height=\"88\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">•</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">查看我的其他模组：</span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/envelope\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/envelope/main.png\" alt=\"信封\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chalk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/L5IBBEH.png\" alt=\"粉笔\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sooty-chimneys\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PHaFgV2.png\" alt=\"烟囱\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wares\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tpmC8km.png\" alt=\"商品\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/monobank\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1Le5yWV.png\" alt=\"单银行\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/thief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/thief/main.png\" alt=\"小偷\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/salt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NhbmXO8.png\" alt=\"盐\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/scholar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/scholar/main-512.png\" alt=\"学者\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/horseman\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/horseman/main.png\" alt=\"骑士\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
